  "passive": {
    "id": "KledPassive",
    "path": "Characters/Kled/Spells/KledPassiveAbility/KledPassive",
    "locKeys": {
      "keyName": "game_character_passiveName_Kled",
      "keyTooltip": "Spell_KledPassive_Tooltip"
    },
    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "겁쟁이 도마뱀 스칼",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">탑승 시:</span> 클레드 대신 스칼이 피해를 입습니다. 스칼의 체력이 소진되면 클레드가 스칼에게서 내립니다.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">미탑승 시:</span> 클레드의 <span></span> 스킬이 변경되고 적 챔피언을 향해 이동할 때 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가 70</span> 증가합니다. 또한 (4 + (1% 추가 체력))의 추가 <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">방어력</span> 및 <span>마법 저항력</span>을 얻으며, 이 수치는 주변 적 챔피언 하나당 30% 증가해 최대 (10 + (2.5% 추가 체력))까지 증가합니다. 미탑승 상태에서 클레드의 기본 공격은 챔피언에게 0% 감소한 피해를 입힙니다.<br /><br />클레드가 챔피언을 공격하면 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">15의 용기</span>, 에픽 몬스터와 구조물을 공격하면 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5의 용기</span>, 미니언을 처치하면 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5의 용기</span>를 얻습니다. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">용기</span>가 최대로 쌓이면 클레드가 30초에 한 번씩 스칼 체력의 70%만큼을 가지고 스칼 위에 다시 탑승합니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Skaarl, the Cowardly Lizard",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mounted:</span> Kled's mount Skaarl takes damage instead of Kled. When his Health depletes, Kled dismounts.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dismounted:</span> Kled replaces <span></span>, gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">70 Move Speed</span> toward enemy champions, and he gains (4 + (1% bonus Health)) bonus <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span>, increased by 30% for each nearby enemy Champion, up to (10 + (2.5% bonus Health)). While dismounted, Kled's attacks deal 0% reduced damage to Champions. <br /><br />Kled gains <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">15 Courage</span> by Attacking champions, <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5 Courage</span> by Attacking epic monsters and structures, and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5 Courage</span> by killing minions. At max <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Courage</span> Kled remounts with 70% of Skaarl's Health, once every 30 seconds."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "怯战蜥蜴斯嘎尔",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">骑乘状态：</span>克烈的坐骑斯嘎尔会代替克烈承受伤害。当斯嘎尔的生命值耗尽时，克烈就会进入非骑乘状态。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">非骑乘状态：</span>克烈替换掉<span></span>，在朝着敌方英雄移动时会获得<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">70移动速度</span>，并且他获得(4 + (1% 额外生命值))额外<span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">护甲</span>和<span>魔法抗性</span>，附近的每个敌方英雄都会使这个加成提升30%，至多至(10 + (2.5% 额外生命值))。在非骑乘状态下，克烈的攻击对英雄造成的伤害降低0%。<br /><br />克烈可通过攻击英雄来获得<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">15勇气</span>、攻击史诗级野怪和建筑物来获得<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5勇气</span>、击杀小兵来获得<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">5勇气</span>。在满层<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">勇气</span>时，克烈会骑着70%生命值的斯嘎尔重回骑乘状态，每30秒一次。"
      }
    }
  }
}